<title>USA: NYMEX PV electric futures set volume record Fri.</title>
<headline>NYMEX PV electric futures set volume record Fri.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Mercantile Exchange said Monday its Palo Verde electricity futures contract set a daily volume record on Friday, January 24, when 319 contracts were traded.</p>
<p>The new record eclipses the old mark of 292 set on March 29, 1996, the first day of trading in the contract, NYMEX said in a statement.</p>
<p>((New York Power Desk 212-859-1624))</p>
</text>
